  "body": "## Summary\n- Detach prints `--state-dir '$HOME/\u2026'` when the store is under the operator home, so a real 1080p cast can pass stage-two redaction.\n- Custom paths outside home are unchanged. No subject, snapshot, or key changes.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] Existing operator_tui PTY cases still apply (tempdir is not under HOME)\n- [ ] Hosted `CI / required`\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
